b_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rhythm game experience required! Play at your own pace, whether you want a challenge or an experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely original soundtrack with over 90-minutes of music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode  with handcrafted levels, and free play until your hands hurt. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually stunning space and meet the KNIGHTS that embody the WELLSPRING.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in private or public lobbies and compare scores in session-based leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your KNIGHT as you progress through the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom charts with workshop integration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced rhythm gameplay with both mouse, controller, and tablet support. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulties and accessibility options to tailor your gaming experience to your preferences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark as a knight alone or with friends in an order chasing their potential. Experience a rhythm game with an original soundtrack, in-depth character customization, and a story following an ensemble cast in a tranquil hub world. What will you find at the peak of what you're chasing?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Hyperbeat's take on the rhythm game is futuristic, original, and not to be missed.”<br>84 – PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/3c72166a30ef049e8d41d05820adc10b7b9ea9e9/header.jpg?t=1787011094", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263360/de4de029e5bd8b10a74348c410f383c9ec380b71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787011094", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.st